    {
      "name": "reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkaU5EN2FBEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 года назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Shortly after the surgery of the knee(torn meniscus repair) which was carried out in the Independent London Hospital in the UK, I had a fantastic chance to work on my pysiotherarpy rehabilitation with Aleksandar who is a fabulous professional with an impressive track record. He is a subject matter expert whose knowledge is based in academic educational background.\nI was delighted by the professional dedication and commitment he showed to me as a patient. His set of exercises assigned to me were very well structured, methodical and ultimately very effective which is the most important. He was continually providing deep and thorough insight about the process of rehabilitation, describing the exercises in detail and illustrating their effect on the joints and muscles. He seems very passionate and enthusiastic about his jobs which motivates a patient to put more effort and raise the bar constantly. Aleksandar has a great social skills which make you feel relaxed and comfortable during the appointment in his office. I would strongly recommend Aleksandar to any individual looking for a professional pysiotherarpy.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Shortly after the surgery of the knee(torn meniscus repair) which was carried out in the Independent London Hospital in the UK, I had a fantastic chance to work on my pysiotherarpy rehabilitation with Aleksandar who is a fabulous professional with an impressive track record. He is a subject matter expert whose knowledge is based in academic educational background.\nI was delighted by the professional dedication and commitment he showed to me as a patient. His set of exercises assigned to me were very well structured, methodical and ultimately very effective which is the most important. He was continually providing deep and thorough insight about the process of rehabilitation, describing the exercises in detail and illustrating their effect on the joints and muscles. He seems very passionate and enthusiastic about his jobs which motivates a patient to put more effort and raise the bar constantly. Aleksandar has a great social skills which make you feel relaxed and comfortable during the appointment in his office. I would strongly recommend Aleksandar to any individual looking for a professional pysiotherarpy.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
